chair accessible</a><br>\n👤 Age requirement: This is an 18+ event<br>\n🎵 Genre: acoustic</p>\n\n<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2>\n<p>Hang Massive fuse the organic, hypnotic tones of the handpan with deep electronic production, creating a world-electronic sound that moves between organic house, downtempo, and global fusion. This late Summer evening, the group returns to London to craft a bespoke outdoor experience in the unique surroundings of Dalston Curve Garden.</p>\n<p>With a small audience, an open sky, and the garden specially lit for the night, Hang Massive will deliver an expansive set from their journey Beyond the Horizon. Join us for an intimate and unforgettable night under the stars. Get your tickets now for Hang Massive in London!</p>\n\n<h2><strong>Frequently asked questions</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"faq-list\">\n  <details>\n    <summary>Where can I view your FAQ’s, and find out more about these beautiful outdoor events?</summary>\n    <p>Visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.woodburner.tv\">here</a>.</p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
